<title>USA: Nutrition Med to buy Elan assets.</title>
<headline>Nutrition Med to buy Elan assets.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nutrition Medical Inc said Tuesday it has entered an agreement to buy certain assets from Elan Pharma Inc, a unit of Ireland-based Elan Corp Plc.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Nutrition Medical will issue 855,000 shares of common stock to Elan and will enter into a $3 million promissory note.</p>
<p>In return, Nutrition Medical will receive certain assets and production rights to Elan's enteral tube feeding formulas and the related delivery devices, tube sets and accessories, the company said.</p>
</text>
